                                        遥控操作：使用无线鼠标键盘对参数进行设置，参数可以设密码保护，非授权人员无法进行操作。                                    ','Remote control operation: Use a wireless mouse and keyboard to set parameters. The parameters can be password protected, so unauthorized personnel cannot operate them.','7b272363eddf89deeaad73bcf2af2fe4',null,null,null,'1776197441');
