                                        隐蔽筛查，可放置在物体、门及墙后，可配合智能手表报警，外形可根据安检场所进行隐蔽设计。                                    ','It is a concealed screening device that can be placed behind objects, doors, and walls. It can be used with smartwatches to trigger alarms, and its shape can be designed to be concealed according to the security check site.','f5fa88f728ef56d4cfdfc5f4902b8966',null,null,null,'1776198228');
