3. 照明角度：1°～20°
                                        ','1. Illumination distance: 300m 2. Laser type: Brand new high-definition floodlight homogenizing light source, free of speckle particles 3. Illumination angle: 1°～20°','588e11cce3d8a08285ccfcb8dea9f43a',null,null,null,'1776205125');
