                                            1. 旋转速度：水平：0.01°/s～180°/s；俯仰：0.01°/s～120°/s，支持焦距转速自适应
2. 旋转角度：水平：360°连续旋转；俯仰：-90°～+90°
3. 预置位巡航：预置位3000个，支持16条巡航路线，每条可支持256个预置位
                                        ','1. Rotation speed: Horizontal: 0.01°/s～180°/s; Pitch: 0.01°/s～120°/s, supports adaptive focal length rotation speed. 2. Rotation angle: Horizontal: 360° continuous rotation; Pitch: -90°～+90° 3. Preset position cruise: 3000 preset positions, supports 16 cruise routes, each supporting 256 preset positions.','af668a34092df6c5137f2fb064e08c10',null,null,null,'1776205125');
