                                           1. 激光类型：808nm（10W、15W、20W）
2. 照明角度：1°～20°/0.5°～20°/0.3°～20°
3. 照射距离：1000m～3000m
4. 光斑形式：500mm以上焦距可选配椭圆光斑照明器，光斑在变化过程中始终保持椭圆形状，与16：9高清摄像机画幅更佳匹配，激光利用率提高30%
                                        ','1. Laser Type: 808nm (10W, 15W, 20W) 2. Illumination Angle: 1°～20°/0.5°～20°/0.3°～20° 3. Illumination Distance: 1000m～3000m 4. Spot Shape: For focal lengths above 500mm, an elliptical spot illuminator can be selected. The spot maintains an elliptical shape throughout its movement, providing better matching with 16:9 high-definition camera aspect ratios and increasing laser utilization by 30%.','c980d88204d6b9b6a54537b76d1aa07d',null,null,null,'1776205834');
INSERT INTO `dr_app_synlang_trans_en` (`id`, `word`, `trans`, `md5`, `field`, `mid`, `cid`, `inputtime`) VALUES ('1867','
