4. 俯仰旋转速度：0.01°/s～15°/s
5. 预置位：不少于255个
                                        ','1. Horizontal rotation range: 360° continuous rotation 2. Pitch rotation range: -45° to +45° 3. Horizontal rotation speed: 0.01°/s to 30°/s 4. Pitch rotation speed: 0.01°/s to 15°/s 5. Preset positions: no less than 255','d1a574b048f5efa9d73601230c2fc269',null,null,null,'1776205834');
