2.自动跟踪：支持支持多场景跟踪、报警联动跟踪
                                        ','1. Intelligent Analysis: Supports area intrusion detection, boundary crossing detection, motion detection, patrol detection, loitering detection, gathering detection, lingering detection, and reverse driving detection. 2. Automatic Tracking: Supports multi-scenario tracking and alarm-linked tracking.','9a1e2e3020a9ac5667612625c0ae0841',null,null,null,'1776205834');
