                                        支持自诊断自恢复，支持强光保护、防太阳灼伤，支持多组态场景模式，大幅提升使用体验、降低使用成本。                                    ','It supports self-diagnosis and self-recovery, strong light protection and sunburn prevention, and multiple configuration scene modes, greatly improving the user experience and reducing the cost of use.','27405c24cade7176abd7ce14c391386b',null,null,null,'1776205877');
